{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 31, :comments ["<b>Do not look</b> — Do not desire to see, even though he gives the wine in a beautiful cup." "<b>its eye</b> — That is, its appearance." "<b>it goes</b> — In the cup." "<b>smoothly</b> — He will think that it is straight and will not harm him."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:24:23.678523644Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}